{"meal_name":"Chicken Stir Fry","difficulty_level":"Easy","servings":4,"researched_ingredients":["1 lb boneless skinless chicken breast, thinly sliced","2 tablespoons vegetable oil","3 cloves garlic, minced","1 tablespoon fresh ginger, grated","1 red bell pepper, sliced","1 yellow bell pepper, sliced","1 cup broccoli florets","1 cup snap peas","3 green onions, sliced","2 tablespoons low-sodium soy sauce","1 tablespoon oyster sauce (look for low-sodium version)","1 teaspoon sesame oil","1 teaspoon cornstarch","2 tablespoons water","Cooked brown rice or quinoa for serving"]}